WEBVTT

01:21.420 --> 01:26.850
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.570 --> 01:29.710
[Episode 31]

01:30.430 --> 01:31.960
You are slandering me!

01:32.789 --> 01:33.509
Master!

01:33.920 --> 01:34.650
Drag him out.

01:35.120 --> 01:35.650
Yes, sir.

01:35.710 --> 01:36.280
You...

01:37.640 --> 01:38.870
I will report this to His Majesty!

01:38.870 --> 01:39.280
Move.

01:39.280 --> 01:41.140
I will report this to His Majesty!

01:41.240 --> 01:46.250
[Xianke Pavilion]

01:41.400 --> 01:41.789
Hurry up.

01:41.789 --> 01:42.640
Let go of me!

01:46.380 --> 01:49.030
[Identity Verified: An Deyu, Investigating Censor of the Censorate]

01:50.120 --> 01:51.039
To the next house.

01:51.039 --> 01:51.509
My Lord,

01:52.680 --> 01:54.310
we've arrested quite a few today.

01:54.310 --> 01:54.840
Do you want to

01:54.840 --> 01:56.150
go back and rest for a bit?

01:56.150 --> 01:57.009
No time to rest.

02:08.150 --> 02:09.880
This bird's nest is excellent.

02:12.590 --> 02:13.590
Have you heard

02:13.840 --> 02:15.280
about Ye Xian?

02:15.710 --> 02:16.750
Yes, I have.

02:17.280 --> 02:18.360
His Majesty has transferred

02:18.360 --> 02:19.630
all cases related to the Inner Court

02:19.630 --> 02:21.120
to the Xuanfeng Guard.

02:21.270 --> 02:23.590
They've arrested
several imperial censors in a row,

02:23.590 --> 02:24.310
all of whom had previously

02:24.310 --> 02:26.240
impeached the Marquis Changxing.

02:26.840 --> 02:27.960
I also heard

02:28.190 --> 02:30.150
he was always frail.

02:30.520 --> 02:31.630
Just climbing a mountain

02:31.630 --> 02:32.310
would cost him

02:32.310 --> 02:33.590
half his life.

02:34.000 --> 02:35.280
How is it that when handling cases,

02:35.280 --> 02:36.430
he is so ruthless?

02:36.960 --> 02:38.280
Isn't it because

02:38.520 --> 02:39.710
his beloved one

02:39.880 --> 02:41.310
was taken away from him?

02:42.000 --> 02:44.130
Speaking of which, I'm quite curious.

02:44.680 --> 02:47.590
Although Madam Chen isn't
from a noble family,

02:47.800 --> 02:48.910
the Gu family

02:49.240 --> 02:50.960
is still a family of scholars.

02:51.430 --> 02:52.960
How did you manage to lure

02:52.960 --> 02:55.240
both Chen and Ye at the same time?

02:55.430 --> 02:56.890
Especially Chen,

02:57.000 --> 02:58.329
who even went so far as to

02:58.430 --> 03:00.560
reject the match proposed by Madam Fu.

03:04.840 --> 03:05.630
Madam Wang,

03:06.120 --> 03:07.400
are you saying Madam Fu

03:07.870 --> 03:09.930
once arranged a match for my husband?

03:10.150 --> 03:11.280
Didn't you know?

03:12.280 --> 03:13.360
No, I didn't.

03:14.280 --> 03:15.300
I only know that

03:15.520 --> 03:16.590
my husband

03:17.079 --> 03:18.190
invited the Senior Grand Secretary

03:18.190 --> 03:20.360
and Madam Fu to officiate our wedding.

03:21.280 --> 03:22.430
Since Madam Fu

03:22.430 --> 03:24.000
was willing to officiate,

03:25.050 --> 03:27.280
it's clear that the matter of matchmaking

03:27.280 --> 03:28.400
is long in the past.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.660
As for you, Madam Wang,

03:32.400 --> 03:33.710
my husband and I

03:33.710 --> 03:35.840
have been married for quite some time,

03:36.190 --> 03:37.390
but you specifically

03:37.520 --> 03:38.800
bring this up today.

03:39.520 --> 03:40.520
Those who know you

03:40.590 --> 03:42.870
might think you're just making small talk.

03:42.870 --> 03:43.930
But those who don't

03:44.310 --> 03:45.079
might think you are

03:45.079 --> 03:46.960
deliberately disrespecting Madam Fu,

03:46.960 --> 03:47.470
trying to sow discord

03:47.470 --> 03:48.800
between Madam Fu and me.

03:50.430 --> 03:51.680
Don't slander me.

03:51.910 --> 03:52.710
Enough.

03:53.960 --> 03:55.590
That's not what I meant.

03:55.590 --> 03:57.079
Madam Chen is right.

03:57.240 --> 03:58.280
It's just a trivial matter.

03:58.280 --> 03:59.610
I've long forgotten it.

04:00.520 --> 04:01.450
We are here today

04:01.450 --> 04:03.230
to taste tea and relax.

04:03.400 --> 04:06.060
There's no need
to mention the trivial details.

04:06.150 --> 04:07.030
Indeed.

04:10.150 --> 04:11.430
The pastries today

04:11.430 --> 04:12.840
are truly excellent.

04:15.910 --> 04:16.870
Yes,

04:17.870 --> 04:19.870
especially this blood bird's nest.

04:20.000 --> 04:21.459
It's smooth and delicate,

04:21.829 --> 04:22.920
very delicious.

04:24.190 --> 04:25.560
But its appearance

04:25.720 --> 04:27.520
looks somewhat like the tribute

04:27.830 --> 04:29.630
sent from Nanyang some time ago.

04:31.510 --> 04:32.159
What...

04:35.560 --> 04:37.090
How could this be a tribute?

04:37.360 --> 04:38.560
You must be mistaken.

04:38.830 --> 04:40.510
I picked up some random pieces

04:40.510 --> 04:41.970
of bird's nest from a shop.

04:42.630 --> 04:43.760
That's impossible.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.430
Earlier, someone

04:45.430 --> 04:47.490
brought top-grade blood bird's nest

04:47.600 --> 04:49.360
to my shop for consignment,

04:49.720 --> 04:51.190
claiming it was surplus tribute.

04:51.190 --> 04:52.190
I saw that

04:52.310 --> 04:53.390
in person.

04:54.040 --> 04:55.170
The appearance

04:55.310 --> 04:56.800
is the same as

04:57.040 --> 04:58.900
the blood bird's nest you served.

04:59.560 --> 05:01.360
But at that time, I was worried,

05:01.800 --> 05:03.400
so I didn't dare accept them.

05:03.750 --> 05:04.830
Madam Wang,

05:05.720 --> 05:06.670
you should also

05:06.920 --> 05:08.040
be more careful.

05:08.680 --> 05:10.950
Make absolutely sure you aren't mistaken.

05:10.950 --> 05:12.360
If it really is a tribute,

05:12.830 --> 05:14.040
that would be bad.

05:15.160 --> 05:15.630
I...

05:16.600 --> 05:17.060
This...

05:17.270 --> 05:18.000
Has the Court underpaid

05:18.000 --> 05:19.310
the Wang family?

05:19.800 --> 05:22.060
To think you would embezzle such things!

05:23.480 --> 05:23.870
No...

05:23.870 --> 05:24.480
Enough.

05:24.950 --> 05:26.750
Let's treat this as an accident.

05:26.750 --> 05:28.040
After everyone goes back,

05:28.040 --> 05:30.300
please do not cause any further trouble.

05:30.870 --> 05:31.600
Madam,

05:32.159 --> 05:33.420
Lord Chen has arrived.

05:33.750 --> 05:35.880
He says he is here to pick up Madam Chen.

05:46.310 --> 05:47.770
Then I shall take my leave.

06:02.560 --> 06:03.430
Tribute?

06:05.040 --> 06:07.040
I didn't want to expose her at first,

06:07.120 --> 06:08.190
but this Madam Wang

06:08.360 --> 06:09.190
has repeatedly

06:09.190 --> 06:10.830
made things difficult for me.

06:10.830 --> 06:12.830
Naturally, I won't indulge her anymore.

06:12.830 --> 06:14.240
I absolutely did not see it wrong.

06:14.240 --> 06:16.440
That was the tribute sent from Nanyang.

06:17.800 --> 06:19.000
You've been wronged.

06:19.190 --> 06:19.870
So wronged.

06:20.000 --> 06:21.530
You shouldn't indulge her.

06:24.920 --> 06:25.720
What's wrong?

06:26.000 --> 06:26.860
I was thinking,

06:26.920 --> 06:28.270
with so many state affairs,

06:28.270 --> 06:30.200
from land reform down to tributes,

06:30.510 --> 06:32.040
they are riddled with holes

06:32.430 --> 06:33.690
and flaws everywhere.

06:34.870 --> 06:37.130
Wang Xuanfan made one careless mistake,

06:37.320 --> 06:39.450
and you actually caught his weakness.

06:39.630 --> 06:40.510
Just watch.

06:41.240 --> 06:42.010
This time,

06:42.830 --> 06:44.560
he has crossed my mentor's bottom line.

06:44.560 --> 06:45.820
He will fly into a rage.

06:48.430 --> 06:51.710
[Wang Residence]

06:50.750 --> 06:51.720
Idiot!

06:51.990 --> 06:53.650
What an absolute idiot!

06:52.670 --> 06:58.920
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

06:54.830 --> 06:55.310
You...

06:56.830 --> 06:58.510
What were you thinking?

06:59.000 --> 07:00.120
What were you thinking

07:00.120 --> 07:02.310
using blood bird's nest to entertain them?

07:02.310 --> 07:02.950
Are you

07:02.950 --> 07:03.870
tired of being a Grand Secretary's wife?

07:03.870 --> 07:05.730
You're pushing me into a fire pit!

07:06.240 --> 07:07.700
How was I supposed to know?

07:07.870 --> 07:09.850
It's boiled and put in a bowl,

07:10.040 --> 07:10.980
yet she could still

07:10.980 --> 07:12.860
know that it's a tribute.

07:13.920 --> 07:14.630
That Gu Jinzhao,

07:14.630 --> 07:16.160
what is her tongue made of?

07:16.630 --> 07:18.030
How could she taste that?

07:18.800 --> 07:20.870
She comes from a wealthy family.

07:20.870 --> 07:22.360
What hasn't she eaten?

07:23.360 --> 07:24.240
All you do

07:24.240 --> 07:25.510
is look down on merchants.

07:25.510 --> 07:26.240
She's eaten more salt

07:26.240 --> 07:27.570
than you've eaten rice!

07:29.120 --> 07:30.600
I look down on merchants?

07:30.720 --> 07:31.830
Do you respect them?

07:31.830 --> 07:33.040
I respect no one,

07:33.040 --> 07:34.510
but I respect wealth.

07:38.070 --> 07:38.630
You...

07:40.070 --> 07:40.920
You must

07:42.040 --> 07:42.600
retrieve the consigned tributes

07:42.600 --> 07:43.680
immediately.

07:44.360 --> 07:45.820
Is it really that serious?

07:46.159 --> 07:47.720
Madam Fu already said

07:48.510 --> 07:49.970
this was just an accident,

07:50.240 --> 07:51.240
and told everyone

07:51.630 --> 07:53.159
not to cause further trouble.

07:53.159 --> 07:54.360
She was just paying lip service,

07:54.360 --> 07:56.090
and you actually believed her?

07:56.430 --> 07:57.510
Over the years, she and
the Senior Grand Secretary

07:57.510 --> 07:58.600
have played good cop, bad cop.

07:58.600 --> 08:00.600
Have you still not figured that out?

08:02.040 --> 08:02.680
I was just recently involved

08:02.680 --> 08:03.630
in the scholars' riot,

08:03.630 --> 08:04.720
which offended the Senior Grand Secretary.

08:04.720 --> 08:06.160
I was counting on you

08:06.600 --> 08:08.330
to coax his wife,

08:08.560 --> 08:10.680
so Madam Fu could use some pillow talk.

08:10.680 --> 08:11.510
But instead,

08:11.720 --> 08:13.310
you drop this disaster on me.

08:13.310 --> 08:14.040
Are you God's punishment

08:14.040 --> 08:15.390
for me?

08:16.600 --> 08:18.070
I'm your punishment?

08:18.800 --> 08:19.270
Wang Xuanfan,

08:19.270 --> 08:20.930
you better explain yourself.

08:21.270 --> 08:22.800
Even the money for you
to travel to the capital for the exams

08:22.800 --> 08:24.700
was provided by my family.

08:25.120 --> 08:26.240
Without me,

08:26.390 --> 08:28.160
would you be where you are today?

08:28.160 --> 08:29.510
How dare you!

08:29.750 --> 08:31.190
When you needed me,

08:31.210 --> 08:32.700
I was your darling.

08:33.000 --> 08:33.960
Now that you don't,

08:33.960 --> 08:35.850
I'm your punishment!

08:35.909 --> 08:37.750
And you call yourself a Grand Secretary?

08:37.750 --> 08:39.470
How can you be so shameless?

08:39.630 --> 08:41.559
You are nothing but a village boor!

08:42.000 --> 08:42.840
Alright, alright.

08:42.840 --> 08:43.630
Calm down. Don't be angry.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.600
I'm sorry.

08:46.200 --> 08:47.480
Look, here's the plan.

08:48.890 --> 08:49.700
Right now,

08:50.320 --> 08:51.080
go immediately and

08:51.080 --> 08:53.360
clean up all the loose ends
regarding the tributes.

08:53.360 --> 08:54.360
I'll make another trip

08:54.360 --> 08:56.750
to the Senior Grand Secretary's residence.

08:56.750 --> 08:57.600
What for?

08:57.720 --> 08:58.840
What else?

08:59.600 --> 09:00.730
To admit my mistake.

09:02.640 --> 09:05.960
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

09:07.740 --> 09:09.580
Chen and his wife

09:10.240 --> 09:11.980
are really so annoying.

09:17.790 --> 09:19.120
Does Lord Wang

09:19.120 --> 09:20.630
admire an official

09:20.630 --> 09:22.000
named Zeng Ruoyu?

09:22.550 --> 09:24.870
Lord Zeng is the Chancellor
of the National Academy.

09:24.870 --> 09:26.530
He is Wang's fellow townsman.

09:26.950 --> 09:28.210
Why do you bring him up?

09:29.510 --> 09:30.240
I know

09:30.240 --> 09:31.910
Wang wants to recommend Lord Zeng

09:31.910 --> 09:33.390
to become the Vice Minister of Rites.

09:33.390 --> 09:34.360
And Lord Yao

09:34.510 --> 09:36.170
even promised to vote for him.

09:36.790 --> 09:37.920
How do you know this?

09:38.670 --> 09:39.790
I also know

09:40.320 --> 09:41.200
Grand Secretary Shen

09:41.200 --> 09:43.860
was reprimanded
by the Senior Grand Secretary.

09:43.960 --> 09:45.510
That was last month.

09:47.150 --> 09:48.910
Where did you hear all this from?

09:48.910 --> 09:49.710
The tea party?

09:51.790 --> 09:53.550
I thought these madams

09:53.550 --> 09:55.030
would chat about things like

09:55.030 --> 09:55.870
the Classic for Girls or whatever

09:55.870 --> 09:57.000
at tea parties.

09:57.510 --> 09:58.360
I never expected

09:58.360 --> 09:59.200
that what they discussed

09:59.200 --> 10:00.860
were entirely court affairs.

10:01.270 --> 10:03.080
And I even saw

10:03.120 --> 10:05.320
Madam Fu comforting Madam Shen, saying

10:06.240 --> 10:06.960
that the Senior Grand Secretary

10:06.960 --> 10:08.510
still trusts Grand Secretary Shen,

10:08.510 --> 10:09.910
telling her not to worry.

10:11.390 --> 10:12.510
So it turns out the tea party

10:12.510 --> 10:13.970
has this kind of function.

10:15.200 --> 10:16.000
Interesting.

10:16.390 --> 10:17.000
Yes.

10:17.150 --> 10:18.360
I think it's even more interesting

10:18.360 --> 10:19.560
than doing business.

10:19.600 --> 10:21.000
Each madam sitting there

10:21.000 --> 10:23.400
is practically a Grand Secretary herself.

10:24.390 --> 10:25.590
A Madam Secretariat.

10:26.870 --> 10:28.000
How can you say that?

10:28.670 --> 10:30.400
That's treasonous, Lord Chen.

10:36.550 --> 10:38.150
I know you like the tea party,

10:38.720 --> 10:39.720
but do you know

10:41.360 --> 10:42.510
if the term Madam Secretariat

10:42.510 --> 10:44.390
reaches the ears of the imperial censors,

10:44.390 --> 10:45.450
what would happen?

10:46.270 --> 10:47.920
You don't want me to go again?

10:48.080 --> 10:49.270
Of course not.

10:50.600 --> 10:51.860
I'm just reminding you

10:52.510 --> 10:53.520
to be careful.

10:53.790 --> 10:54.630
I know.

10:55.270 --> 10:57.350
Besides, I've already asked around.

10:57.440 --> 10:59.240
The tea parties started several years ago

10:59.240 --> 11:01.100
and have been going on ever since.

11:01.750 --> 11:03.360
Moreover, these Grand Secretaries

11:03.360 --> 11:04.510
use their wives

11:04.750 --> 11:06.840
to exchange information with each other.

11:06.840 --> 11:07.960
You've been following
Senior Grand Secretary

11:07.960 --> 11:08.960
for so many years,

11:09.120 --> 11:11.450
yet you didn't know about the tea parties.

11:12.510 --> 11:13.210
Exactly.

11:13.550 --> 11:14.810
It's a huge loss for me.

11:15.840 --> 11:17.370
Luckily, I found out today.

11:17.550 --> 11:18.150
That's why

11:19.320 --> 11:20.780
I was so eager to marry you.

12:18.720 --> 12:20.590
Gu Jinzhao.

12:34.510 --> 12:35.950
Look at my lips.

12:36.030 --> 12:38.430
I need to go
to Linxia Restaurant tomorrow.

12:54.790 --> 12:55.520
Third Uncle.

12:55.550 --> 12:56.480
Why are you here?

12:57.080 --> 12:58.140
What's the matter?

12:59.240 --> 13:01.010
It's about those scholars.

13:02.440 --> 13:03.670
I heard some rumors

13:03.960 --> 13:06.090
that might be disadvantageous to you.

13:12.000 --> 13:13.060
I'll be right back.

13:13.510 --> 13:14.640
You go inside first.

13:17.510 --> 13:18.110
Follow me.

13:36.270 --> 13:36.840
My Lady.

13:42.840 --> 13:43.320
This...

13:44.550 --> 13:45.480
Throw this away,

13:46.080 --> 13:46.950
far away.

13:47.320 --> 13:48.120
The farther, the better.

13:48.120 --> 13:48.600
Yes.

13:52.000 --> 13:52.800
What's wrong?

13:53.270 --> 13:55.070
Did someone plead for leniency?

13:56.840 --> 13:57.390
Yes.

13:58.000 --> 14:00.200
I dare not hide it from you, Third Uncle.

14:01.080 --> 14:02.870
Indeed, the families

14:02.870 --> 14:04.600
and teachers of some scholars came to me,

14:04.600 --> 14:06.060
but I turned them all away.

14:06.790 --> 14:07.360
However,

14:07.600 --> 14:09.660
I've also heard some rumors outside.

14:09.790 --> 14:11.960
They say you disregard the Court's laws

14:11.960 --> 14:13.240
and detain those scholars

14:13.240 --> 14:14.770
in the Shuntian Prefecture

14:15.200 --> 14:17.060
just to vent your personal anger.

14:19.000 --> 14:19.930
Personal anger?

14:21.670 --> 14:22.870
Even if it is,

14:23.270 --> 14:24.670
it's not entirely wrong.

14:26.630 --> 14:28.440
I'm afraid imperial censors
might impeach you.

14:28.440 --> 14:29.600
So you came to me

14:30.440 --> 14:31.030
to ask me

14:31.030 --> 14:32.560
to release those scholars?

14:34.320 --> 14:36.120
You are perceptive, Third Uncle.

14:36.120 --> 14:37.270
The reason those scholars

14:37.270 --> 14:38.750
did such a thing was entirely

14:38.750 --> 14:40.240
out of a moment of righteous indignation.

14:40.240 --> 14:41.570
What do you mean by that?

14:42.120 --> 14:43.510
Just the fact that they could precisely

14:43.510 --> 14:45.110
block my carriage on the road

14:45.750 --> 14:47.670
shows it wasn't just pure impulse,

14:47.670 --> 14:48.240
not to mention

14:48.240 --> 14:49.810
those flags and banners.

14:49.960 --> 14:50.670
If they hadn't prepared

14:50.670 --> 14:51.390
a day or two in advance,

14:51.390 --> 14:52.840
it would have been impossible.

14:52.840 --> 14:53.600
You jump to conclusions

14:53.600 --> 14:55.270
about things you haven't seen

14:55.440 --> 14:56.500
with your own eyes.

14:56.750 --> 14:58.010
Are you being foolish,

14:59.120 --> 15:00.920
or do you have ulterior motives?

15:03.030 --> 15:03.750
I was wrong.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.240
I shouldn't have easily believed

15:05.240 --> 15:06.170
their nonsense.

15:08.320 --> 15:10.120
Please forgive me, Third Uncle.

15:14.390 --> 15:15.990
You are an ambitious person.

15:16.200 --> 15:17.670
But the greatest weakness
for ambitious people

15:17.670 --> 15:19.270
is having high aims
but lacking the talent.

15:19.270 --> 15:21.670
If you pick up the habit
of being self-righteous

15:21.670 --> 15:23.510
and believing every rumor you hear,

15:23.510 --> 15:25.440
how can you enter the Cabinet
in the future?

15:25.440 --> 15:27.550
You won't even get your foot in the door.

15:27.550 --> 15:28.120
Get up.

15:33.510 --> 15:35.390
You don't need to
worry about this anymore.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.840
If life in the Hanlin Academy

15:36.840 --> 15:38.100
is far too idle for you,

15:39.880 --> 15:41.810
you can think about your marriage.

15:41.960 --> 15:43.960
The Yu family has urged us many times.

15:43.960 --> 15:44.720
Within this year,

15:44.720 --> 15:47.250
we'll arrange the wedding
for you and Wanxue.

15:47.910 --> 15:48.510
Yes.

15:52.720 --> 15:53.510
Then I shall

15:54.150 --> 15:55.280
take my leave first.

15:55.550 --> 15:56.150
You may go.

16:09.030 --> 16:09.840
Xuanqing?

16:17.360 --> 16:18.160
Third Master,

16:21.200 --> 16:22.080
what happened?

16:22.630 --> 16:24.240
Xuanqing came to me just now.

16:24.510 --> 16:26.120
He clearly wanted to plead

16:26.270 --> 16:28.150
for the scholars
who blocked my sedan chair.

16:28.150 --> 16:29.200
But he seemed to have no idea

16:29.200 --> 16:30.510
how to speak for them.

16:31.120 --> 16:33.670
It felt more like
a spur-of-the-moment decision.

16:33.670 --> 16:34.670
Enough about him.

16:35.870 --> 16:36.480
How is it?

16:38.120 --> 16:39.910
Wang Xuanfan's embezzlement
of the tributes

16:39.910 --> 16:41.570
has been fully investigated.

16:43.960 --> 16:44.440
Here.

16:45.290 --> 16:48.080
[To the Honorable Master]

16:47.180 --> 16:49.000
Every year, the tributes from all regions

16:49.000 --> 16:51.060
are first sent to the Wang residence.

16:51.120 --> 16:52.340
The Wang family opened a store
in the capital

16:52.340 --> 16:54.080
to sell specialties from the south,

16:54.080 --> 16:55.320
claiming to exclusively
sell surplus tributes,

16:55.320 --> 16:57.180
but they are the actual tributes.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.710
This man is incredibly audacious.

16:58.710 --> 16:59.050
[My investigation of the tribute officials and escorts]

16:59.080 --> 16:59.500
[confirms that upon the annual tributes' arrival in the capital,]

16:59.360 --> 17:00.750
Should we arrange for someone

16:59.520 --> 16:59.890
[a portion must first be diverted to the Wang residence.]

16:59.920 --> 17:00.350
[The ledger records tributes like
Nanyang blood bird's nest and Fujian rock tea;]

17:00.370 --> 17:00.840
[these transactions, when cross-checked with the imperial registry,]

17:00.870 --> 17:01.360
[show exact matches in patterns and styles across many items.]

17:00.900 --> 17:01.760
to impeach him?

17:05.960 --> 17:06.960
Same as last time.

17:07.680 --> 17:08.680
Just impeach him.

17:08.829 --> 17:10.230
Don't be too aggressive,

17:10.270 --> 17:12.069
and don't pursue it relentlessly.

17:12.069 --> 17:12.800
Understood.

17:13.790 --> 17:15.010
Just a light tap.

17:15.160 --> 17:15.720
Exactly.

17:21.349 --> 17:22.400
My mentor regards Wang Xuanfan

17:22.400 --> 17:23.680
as his right-hand man.

17:24.920 --> 17:26.619
To get rid of him,

17:27.510 --> 17:28.550
we need to take slow, steady steps,

17:28.550 --> 17:30.510
wearing him down bit by bit.

17:33.790 --> 17:35.720
In the disaster relief grain case,

17:35.750 --> 17:36.750
Madam Wang

17:37.240 --> 17:39.510
took dividends from the grain merchants.

17:39.510 --> 17:40.720
That's one piece lost.

17:40.720 --> 17:43.400
Wang Xuanfan incited the scholars
to block my sedan chair,

17:43.400 --> 17:44.600
angering His Majesty

17:45.440 --> 17:47.330
and disrupting the land reform.

17:51.680 --> 17:53.140
That's three pieces lost.

17:56.600 --> 17:57.640
Wang Xuanfan

17:57.850 --> 17:59.140
embezzled tributes.

18:00.270 --> 18:01.800
That's another piece lost.

18:12.720 --> 18:13.680
It seems

18:14.590 --> 18:16.450
a couple more strikes are needed.

18:17.350 --> 18:17.960
Soon.

18:25.730 --> 18:28.870
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

18:29.070 --> 18:29.830
Get out!

18:30.780 --> 18:32.090
Did I tell you to come in?

18:32.090 --> 18:33.550
You have no manners at all!

18:37.550 --> 18:38.960
Please calm your anger, Yuanweng.

18:38.960 --> 18:41.000
Actually, the Senior Grand Secretary

18:41.000 --> 18:43.000
treats you as one of his own,

18:43.310 --> 18:45.270
which is why he was so blunt.

18:45.390 --> 18:48.650
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

18:45.720 --> 18:46.850
You call that blunt?

18:47.480 --> 18:48.830
That was a slap in the face!

18:48.830 --> 18:50.630
Slapping me time and time again!

18:54.000 --> 18:55.550
Last time it was
in front of Third Mr. Chen,

18:55.550 --> 18:57.310
this time it was in front of His Majesty.

18:57.310 --> 18:58.070
Just because a few

18:58.070 --> 18:59.160
ignorant scholars shouted a few words

18:59.160 --> 19:00.680
about liquidating the imperial estates,

19:00.680 --> 19:02.030
he... he reprimanded me,

19:02.030 --> 19:04.400
saying I was acting out
and told me to step down!

19:04.400 --> 19:05.240
Haven't I done enough

19:05.240 --> 19:06.830
for land reform?

19:07.350 --> 19:08.480
I gave so much money

19:08.640 --> 19:09.880
to make up for it the moment he asked.

19:09.880 --> 19:11.260
Wasn't it all for him?

19:24.670 --> 19:25.930
Actually I don't blame

19:27.790 --> 19:29.400
the Senior Grand Secretary.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.910
He had no choice.

19:31.070 --> 19:32.670
He was put on the spot by Chen.

19:33.070 --> 19:33.790
Exactly.

19:34.620 --> 19:36.060
In this scholar riot,

19:36.310 --> 19:37.350
if Chen Yanyun truly

19:37.350 --> 19:39.030
considered the bigger picture,

19:39.030 --> 19:40.000
he could have easily

19:40.000 --> 19:41.440
covered the matter up right there.

19:41.440 --> 19:42.550
But instead,

19:43.310 --> 19:45.270
he sent the scholars and their banners

19:45.270 --> 19:47.490
straight to the Shuntian Prefecture.

19:47.590 --> 19:48.550
It's such a huge incident.

19:48.550 --> 19:49.960
I couldn't keep it hidden either,

19:49.960 --> 19:51.270
so I had to report it upwards.

19:51.270 --> 19:52.420
Alright, alright.

19:53.680 --> 19:55.210
I'm not blaming you either.

19:58.320 --> 20:01.410
[Integrity, Prudence, Diligence, Harmony]

20:06.780 --> 20:08.340
I reflected carefully.

20:09.130 --> 20:10.310
If I'm not mistaken,

20:11.510 --> 20:14.400
ever since he took down Fan Chuan
in the disaster relief grain case,

20:14.400 --> 20:15.200
Chen had already

20:15.200 --> 20:16.460
started targeting me.

20:16.880 --> 20:17.960
He resented me for making him

20:17.960 --> 20:20.000
take the blame for the grain swap.

20:22.030 --> 20:23.740
So narrow-minded.

20:34.240 --> 20:35.970
We've been talking for so long.

20:36.270 --> 20:37.510
I'm getting tired.

20:41.640 --> 20:44.120
Then we shall take our leave.

20:47.270 --> 20:48.460
Hold on, Ziliang.

20:49.400 --> 20:50.930
I have something to ask you.

21:11.030 --> 21:12.030
I remember Gu Deyuan, the Censorate's

21:12.030 --> 21:13.690
Assistant Censor-in-Chief,

21:13.920 --> 21:15.000
was previously involved in

21:15.000 --> 21:17.550
the embezzlement case of Zeng Yanqiu,
the Vice Minister of Works.

21:17.550 --> 21:19.280
Later, it was left unresolved.

21:22.400 --> 21:23.680
A person used to taking bribes

21:23.680 --> 21:25.450
can never restrain themselves.

21:25.450 --> 21:27.400
Now that he has become in-laws with Chen,

21:27.400 --> 21:28.680
with such a big backer,

21:30.070 --> 21:32.200
I think he's going to make a move again.

21:32.640 --> 21:33.270
Yes.

21:35.270 --> 21:36.200
However,

21:36.680 --> 21:38.880
why didn't you hand this over to Lord Yao?

21:38.880 --> 21:40.000
Wouldn't it be more convenient

21:40.000 --> 21:41.550
for the Ministry of Justice
to investigate this?

21:41.550 --> 21:43.160
Gu Deyuan's daughter

21:44.350 --> 21:46.480
is married to Yao Ping's youngest son.

22:07.400 --> 22:08.030
Zhao,

22:08.310 --> 22:09.400
we've selected a few varieties

22:09.400 --> 22:10.550
of newly released tea.

22:10.550 --> 22:11.830
We can't quite make up our minds,

22:11.830 --> 22:13.490
so we'd like you to take a look.

22:15.200 --> 22:15.950
Lan,

22:16.640 --> 22:17.920
preparing for the Linxia Restaurant

22:17.920 --> 22:19.720
involves a lot of trivial matters.

22:19.720 --> 22:21.180
Thanks for your hard work.

22:23.590 --> 22:25.800
[Snow Orchid Breaths on Jade] [Twilight Lotus Diffuses Scent]

22:23.880 --> 22:25.060
During my home visit this time,

22:25.060 --> 22:26.440
I didn't go back to Daxin.

22:26.440 --> 22:28.510
Did they make things difficult for you?

22:28.510 --> 22:29.790
It was alright, actually.

22:29.790 --> 22:31.850
Grandmother didn't even bring it up.

22:31.880 --> 22:33.240
Second Aunt and Lian

22:33.240 --> 22:34.300
made a few remarks.

22:35.000 --> 22:36.730
I didn't care about them at all.

22:37.270 --> 22:38.030
However,

22:38.960 --> 22:40.400
I do have a favor

22:40.400 --> 22:41.550
to ask of you.

22:42.790 --> 22:43.560
Go ahead.

22:43.920 --> 22:45.820
I want to move back to Sili Hutong.

22:46.240 --> 22:48.070
Now that you've married
into the Chen Mansion,

22:48.070 --> 22:49.200
Father has been assigned
outside the capital,

22:49.200 --> 22:50.030
and Rong is always

22:50.030 --> 22:51.380
at the Qifang Hutong Academy.

22:51.380 --> 22:53.270
It's just me alone in the ancestral home,

22:53.270 --> 22:54.530
which is quite boring.

22:58.070 --> 22:59.470
That is indeed an option.

23:00.160 --> 23:02.290
However, you need to think it through.

23:03.240 --> 23:04.070
After all, you are an

23:04.070 --> 23:05.240
unmarried lady.

23:05.720 --> 23:07.860
Setting up a household on your own

23:08.440 --> 23:10.270
will inevitably invite gossip.

23:10.510 --> 23:11.370
I'm not afraid.

23:12.350 --> 23:14.080
I just want to live more freely,

23:14.270 --> 23:16.270
which is better than anything else.

23:16.920 --> 23:18.110
Since you've thought it through,

23:18.110 --> 23:19.270
then go ahead and move.

23:19.270 --> 23:20.830
The property deed for Sili Hutong

23:20.830 --> 23:21.590
is with me.

23:22.270 --> 23:23.720
You have a share.

23:24.680 --> 23:26.150
If you have spare money,

23:26.350 --> 23:28.000
I can sell my share to you too.

23:28.640 --> 23:30.750
Consider it as acquiring an estate.

23:32.440 --> 23:33.500
That's wonderful!

23:34.000 --> 23:35.600
Thank you.

23:35.750 --> 23:36.430
Sit down.

23:39.550 --> 23:40.720
[Twilight Lotus Diffuses Scent
]

23:41.680 --> 23:42.280
By the way,

23:43.640 --> 23:44.840
do you still remember

23:44.880 --> 23:46.620
Mu Zhidi?

23:47.830 --> 23:48.790
The one who

23:49.000 --> 23:50.160
looks a bit silly?

23:50.350 --> 23:51.240
His father,

23:51.350 --> 23:52.440
Lord Mu Shi'an,

23:52.750 --> 23:55.280
is a longtime friend
of your brother-in-law.

23:55.510 --> 23:56.310
This time,

23:56.510 --> 23:57.770
he brought it up again.

23:58.030 --> 23:59.560
I told your brother-in-law

23:59.750 --> 24:01.880
that when they brought it up
the year before last,

24:01.880 --> 24:03.280
you had already refused.

24:03.550 --> 24:04.510
Your brother-in-law

24:04.510 --> 24:05.890
knows all of this.

24:06.350 --> 24:07.000
Then,

24:07.550 --> 24:08.640
what does he think?

24:09.240 --> 24:10.590
Your brother-in-law says

24:10.590 --> 24:11.590
Mr. Mu

24:11.790 --> 24:12.850
is a decent person,

24:13.510 --> 24:15.590
and Mu family has a good reputation.

24:16.160 --> 24:16.880
However,

24:16.880 --> 24:18.610
marriage is a lifelong matter.

24:19.270 --> 24:21.060
You must think it through

24:21.160 --> 24:22.220
and don't force it.

24:23.440 --> 24:25.300
Since my brother-in-law says so,

24:25.750 --> 24:26.310
then,

24:26.440 --> 24:27.240
could you

24:27.240 --> 24:28.700
arrange for Mu Zhidi and me

24:28.790 --> 24:29.510
to meet?

24:29.680 --> 24:30.310
Sure.

24:31.030 --> 24:32.690
Then I'll pick a suitable time

24:32.920 --> 24:34.160
for you two to meet.

24:34.510 --> 24:36.170
We'll talk more about it then.

24:39.920 --> 24:40.520
By the way,

24:42.070 --> 24:43.160
I heard

24:43.960 --> 24:46.270
Ye Xian has been acting like a madman,

24:47.000 --> 24:49.130
angering quite a few court officials.

24:49.550 --> 24:50.350
It's true?

24:56.870 --> 25:01.710
[Ye Residence]

25:21.440 --> 25:22.270
Pass it down to him?

25:22.270 --> 25:23.450
Can he even swing it?

25:24.000 --> 25:25.530
Look at his frail physique,

25:25.680 --> 25:28.680
he can forget about
wielding a sword in this lifetime!

25:33.790 --> 25:35.890
Fu Hailian is absolutely determined

25:35.960 --> 25:37.270
to see me dead.

25:37.880 --> 25:39.400
And you came in to accompany me?

25:39.400 --> 25:40.830
Do you think you're being a filial son?

25:40.830 --> 25:41.790
Foolish!

25:42.440 --> 25:43.960
Figure out a way to get out of here.

25:43.960 --> 25:46.020
Protect your mother and your sister.

25:46.350 --> 25:48.820
If the Marquis's mansion is gone,
so be it.

25:49.200 --> 25:50.130
You never wanted

25:50.680 --> 25:53.000
to inherit the title anyway.

26:33.200 --> 26:35.190
It's very kind of you to think of my lord,

26:35.190 --> 26:36.880
and even invite a renowned doctor.

26:36.880 --> 26:38.160
It's just that lately,

26:38.830 --> 26:40.830
his temper has become more eccentric.

26:40.830 --> 26:42.510
If he speaks harshly,

26:42.960 --> 26:44.510
please bear with him.

26:47.440 --> 26:49.350
Don't I know his temper well enough?

26:49.350 --> 26:50.680
Don't worry about that.

26:53.350 --> 26:55.000
My Lord, Miss Xue is here.

26:55.200 --> 26:56.440
She specially brought a renowned doctor.

26:56.440 --> 26:57.160
Ye Xian!

26:57.720 --> 26:58.270
My Lord!

27:29.440 --> 27:30.110
Doctor,

27:30.680 --> 27:31.960
My lord has already finished his medicine.

27:31.960 --> 27:33.560
Why isn't he getting better?

27:36.690 --> 27:38.090
What exactly is going on?

27:38.510 --> 27:39.770
Please speak frankly.

27:40.550 --> 27:42.640
His chronic illness is hard to cure.

27:43.510 --> 27:45.200
I'm afraid his life

27:46.350 --> 27:47.880
won't last much longer.

27:47.880 --> 27:48.550
What?

27:49.400 --> 27:50.070
Doctor,

27:50.240 --> 27:51.760
I beg you, please save him!

27:51.790 --> 27:53.540
I'll kowtow to you, Doctor!

27:53.570 --> 27:54.240
Please get up quickly.

27:54.240 --> 27:55.640
-I beg you!
-Doctor Zhou,

27:56.870 --> 27:59.000
if I ask you to treat him
with all your might,

27:59.000 --> 28:00.130
how long can he live?

28:02.960 --> 28:04.270
At most,

28:05.310 --> 28:06.680
three years.

28:11.590 --> 28:12.590
Three years?

28:14.500 --> 28:15.660
Don't cry here.

28:18.790 --> 28:19.440
Ruixiang,

28:19.750 --> 28:21.310
take Doctor Zhou
to write the prescription.

28:21.310 --> 28:21.920
Yes.

28:33.590 --> 28:34.440
You're awake?

28:51.720 --> 28:52.510
Actually...

28:53.550 --> 28:54.510
actually, Doctor Zhou's

28:54.510 --> 28:55.960
prognosis might not be accurate.

28:55.960 --> 28:57.000
We need to consult a few more doctors

28:57.000 --> 28:57.900
to be certain.

28:58.440 --> 29:00.680
I heard there's an imperial physician
in Songjiang Prefecture...

29:00.680 --> 29:01.740
Don't tell anyone.

29:07.070 --> 29:09.530
The fact that I only have
three years to live.

29:12.070 --> 29:14.070
I hope you can keep it a secret for me.

29:14.750 --> 29:15.980
Didn't I just say?

29:16.010 --> 29:17.000
What Doctor Zhou said

29:17.000 --> 29:17.550
might not be accurate.

29:17.550 --> 29:18.680
-He is right.
-He...

29:20.200 --> 29:21.030
Three years

29:24.060 --> 29:24.740
is enough.

29:38.640 --> 29:39.770
Where are you going?

29:41.480 --> 29:42.070
Shut up.

29:44.510 --> 29:47.040
Were you going to say
it's none of my business?

29:48.440 --> 29:49.510
I just saved your life,

29:49.510 --> 29:51.510
and you'd better have a conscience.

29:55.510 --> 29:57.440
I'm going to Zhending Prefecture.

29:59.510 --> 30:00.240
For work?

30:02.750 --> 30:03.400
In your condition,

30:03.400 --> 30:04.720
how can you work?

30:06.270 --> 30:07.270
Let me go with you.

30:09.160 --> 30:09.720
Didn't you say

30:09.720 --> 30:11.180
I should keep your secret?

30:11.510 --> 30:12.710
Then take me with you.

30:13.400 --> 30:14.550
Otherwise,

30:15.590 --> 30:17.290
if I get drunk one day,

30:17.440 --> 30:18.030
and accidentally slip up,

30:18.030 --> 30:19.560
I might just tell everyone.

30:55.550 --> 30:56.310
You're back?

30:58.440 --> 30:59.540
You're late today.

31:00.400 --> 31:02.200
I had already finished my shift,

31:02.550 --> 31:05.270
but my mentor suddenly remembered
the river project,

31:05.270 --> 31:07.000
and insisted on discussing it.

31:07.440 --> 31:08.370
This discussion

31:08.750 --> 31:10.010
took four whole hours.

31:29.990 --> 31:31.390
Seeing you look like this

31:32.030 --> 31:33.000
reminds me

31:33.000 --> 31:34.160
of an idiom.

31:34.960 --> 31:35.560
What is it?

31:40.270 --> 31:41.930
Standing by with folded arms.

31:44.160 --> 31:45.070
Listen to that,

31:45.750 --> 31:46.510
someone is

31:46.510 --> 31:48.840
complaining that I'm not a virtuous wife.

31:50.880 --> 31:53.350
Let me attend to Lord Chen right now.

31:54.310 --> 31:56.750
Let me serve you well.

32:02.440 --> 32:03.350
-Lord Chen,
-That's more like it.

32:03.350 --> 32:04.410
please have a seat.

32:23.000 --> 32:24.530
Let's see where you can run.

32:27.070 --> 32:28.070
What should we do?

32:28.160 --> 32:29.410
Yanyun didn't marry

32:29.440 --> 32:30.920
a virtuous wife.

32:31.550 --> 32:33.210
You don't need to be virtuous.

32:33.310 --> 32:34.640
This is perfectly fine.

32:35.270 --> 32:36.120
I like it.

32:39.990 --> 32:40.910
Besides,

32:42.200 --> 32:43.660
you have other strengths.

32:44.350 --> 32:44.960
What?

32:45.550 --> 32:46.200
Guess.

32:49.070 --> 32:49.920
You're rich.

32:50.550 --> 32:51.200
Hey.

32:57.590 --> 32:58.350
Don't move.

32:58.790 --> 33:00.320
Let me hold you a bit longer.

33:05.750 --> 33:06.590
What's wrong?

33:06.960 --> 33:07.770
Tired today?

33:08.160 --> 33:08.890
I'm alright,

33:10.550 --> 33:12.010
just need to hold you more.

33:20.230 --> 33:20.830
By the way,

33:22.160 --> 33:23.420
Mother fell ill today,

33:23.720 --> 33:25.720
but she didn't call for a physician.

33:26.350 --> 33:27.880
Do you want to go take a look?

33:33.680 --> 33:34.310
No need.

33:35.270 --> 33:36.060
Last night,

33:36.440 --> 33:38.040
I already told her the truth.

33:39.550 --> 33:40.310
No wonder.

33:47.310 --> 33:48.640
Tell me,

33:49.510 --> 33:50.640
how could Yanwen

33:52.790 --> 33:53.830
do...

33:55.240 --> 33:56.590
do

33:56.590 --> 33:58.790
such things?

34:01.580 --> 34:02.940
Since he was little,

34:04.270 --> 34:07.780
I hired renowned teachers for him,

34:09.150 --> 34:10.510
and gave him

34:12.030 --> 34:13.030
the exact same education

34:13.030 --> 34:15.429
like his brothers.

34:15.550 --> 34:17.760
You must not blame yourself.

34:18.510 --> 34:19.590
They say a dragon has nine sons,

34:19.590 --> 34:21.190
and each one is uniquely different.

34:21.190 --> 34:22.920
If Fourth Master grew up astray,

34:22.920 --> 34:24.449
how could anyone blame you?

34:24.760 --> 34:25.760
Besides,

34:25.920 --> 34:27.980
if you ask around the entire capital,

34:28.070 --> 34:31.270
no one raises the younger generations
better than you do.

34:31.280 --> 34:32.880
Not to mention Third Master,

34:33.150 --> 34:34.510
who is highly respected
as a Grand Secretary.

34:34.510 --> 34:35.190
Second Master,

34:35.190 --> 34:36.960
is also a high-ranking
provincial official.

34:36.960 --> 34:37.920
And in the next generation,

34:37.920 --> 34:38.949
Xuanqing,

34:39.190 --> 34:40.920
is a dignified Tanhua scholar.

34:41.110 --> 34:41.909
In the future,

34:42.070 --> 34:44.330
he might also become
a Cabinet Minister.

34:47.440 --> 34:49.860
As long as you keep an open mind,

34:50.000 --> 34:51.440
and don't dwell on a dead end,

34:51.440 --> 34:52.659
your days

34:52.800 --> 34:55.130
will surely be harmonious and beautiful.

34:56.400 --> 34:57.280
I know.

35:00.840 --> 35:01.800
Actually,

35:02.360 --> 35:03.820
Mother had long suspected

35:04.000 --> 35:05.660
that he harmed Fifth Brother.

35:06.030 --> 35:07.960
She just didn't want to believe it.

35:10.550 --> 35:11.280
Yesterday,

35:13.510 --> 35:14.680
when I told her

35:14.710 --> 35:15.760
that he was the one who hired people

35:15.760 --> 35:16.960
to kidnap you,

35:18.700 --> 35:20.300
she understood everything.

35:20.510 --> 35:21.320
She even asked

35:22.400 --> 35:23.470
if Fourth Brother

35:23.840 --> 35:25.440
will never come back again.

35:30.710 --> 35:32.040
You don't need to worry.

35:33.200 --> 35:34.800
With Mother's personality,

35:35.070 --> 35:36.190
in a couple of days,

35:37.070 --> 35:38.060
she'll be able to

35:38.190 --> 35:39.760
step out decently again

35:40.440 --> 35:42.240
and be the respected matriarch.

35:46.840 --> 35:49.040
Every family has its own difficulties.

35:52.280 --> 35:53.920
But in our family

35:54.320 --> 35:55.780
things are not difficult.

36:06.410 --> 36:08.320
[Gu Mansion]

36:08.500 --> 36:10.570
[Moonlit Seclusion]

36:12.830 --> 36:15.730
[Blessings Passed Down for Generations]

36:16.320 --> 36:17.280
Zhao!

36:19.980 --> 36:22.230
[Blessings Passed Down for Generations]

36:20.630 --> 36:21.480
Lan,

36:22.320 --> 36:23.230
congratulations!

36:22.350 --> 36:25.850
[Snow from Yingzhong]

36:23.230 --> 36:24.630
You move to your new home!

36:24.710 --> 36:25.800
Thank you.

36:26.590 --> 36:28.350
Yanying was going to come too,

36:28.510 --> 36:29.720
but for no reasons,

36:29.920 --> 36:30.670
starting from today,

36:30.670 --> 36:32.510
she's been having an upset stomach.

36:32.510 --> 36:34.280
Perhaps she was greedy last night,

36:34.280 --> 36:35.880
and had too many cold things.

36:35.880 --> 36:36.920
So as for her gift,

36:36.920 --> 36:38.780
she had to ask me to bring it to you.

36:38.920 --> 36:40.480
There will be many
opportunities in the future.

36:40.480 --> 36:43.010
Next time I will send her
another invitation.

36:43.670 --> 36:44.630
Where is Wanxue?

36:46.510 --> 36:47.510
She should be here soon.

36:47.490 --> 36:50.020
[Blessings Passed Down for Generations]

36:48.250 --> 36:49.390
I'm here!

36:54.360 --> 36:55.420
Just before leaving the house,

36:55.420 --> 36:55.920
my stepmother

36:55.920 --> 36:57.280
suddenly asked about my embroidery.

36:57.280 --> 36:58.800
If I hadn't prepared in advance,

36:58.800 --> 37:00.930
I fear I would have missed lunch today.

37:01.510 --> 37:02.280
Dear Lan,

37:02.280 --> 37:03.670
congratulations on your new home.

37:03.670 --> 37:04.590
Thank you.

37:05.800 --> 37:06.840
With her here,

37:06.840 --> 37:08.640
it's definitely going to be fun.

37:10.510 --> 37:11.410
Is Mr. Mu

37:11.920 --> 37:13.550
also coming today?

37:17.670 --> 37:18.840
What are you afraid of?

37:18.840 --> 37:20.900
You are the head of the household now.

37:20.930 --> 37:21.810
He's coming over

37:21.810 --> 37:23.630
to congratulate you on your new home too.

37:23.630 --> 37:24.400
You should

37:24.400 --> 37:26.280
greet him naturally.

37:26.840 --> 37:29.450
Zhao, please come with me.

37:29.800 --> 37:30.480
Alright.

37:33.000 --> 37:35.110
My Lady, Mr. Mu has arrived.

37:59.280 --> 38:00.280
Xuanqing!

38:17.060 --> 38:20.150
[Harmony Brings Blessings]

38:35.500 --> 38:36.950
Mu Zhidi

38:37.270 --> 38:39.330
bowed about eighteen times already.

38:39.360 --> 38:40.480
Poor thing.

38:41.230 --> 38:42.510
Since you invited him over,

38:42.510 --> 38:44.070
you can't just not say a single word,

38:44.070 --> 38:45.930
and ignore him like this, can you?

38:46.510 --> 38:46.960
I...

38:47.230 --> 38:48.630
I don't know what to say.

39:00.880 --> 39:01.760
Wanxue,

39:03.630 --> 39:05.510
this is your first time in this residence?

39:05.510 --> 39:06.710
I'll show you around.

39:07.150 --> 39:07.710
Okay!

39:21.760 --> 39:22.590
In that case,

39:25.030 --> 39:26.230
I'll go for a walk too.

39:40.360 --> 39:41.190
Mr. Mu,

39:41.760 --> 39:42.560
how about

39:42.760 --> 39:44.070
we go for a walk too?

39:44.230 --> 39:45.230
Sure, sure.

40:05.110 --> 40:06.070
Mr. Mu,

40:06.610 --> 40:08.380
my inviting you here this time

40:08.960 --> 40:11.360
is actually not a genuine attempt
at matchmaking.

40:11.360 --> 40:12.280
Rather,

40:12.440 --> 40:13.960
I didn't want to brush off my sister

40:13.960 --> 40:16.220
and brother-in-law's good intentions.

40:19.670 --> 40:20.590
I have actually

40:20.760 --> 40:21.960
made up my mind

40:22.360 --> 40:23.400
to never marry.

40:23.960 --> 40:24.510
Why?

40:26.000 --> 40:27.660
You should know my situation.

40:27.880 --> 40:30.400
My father was demoted
to Pingyang Prefecture,

40:30.400 --> 40:31.730
and my mom made a mistake

40:32.150 --> 40:34.010
and is still locked up to this day.

40:34.520 --> 40:36.580
I also made many mistakes in the past.

40:37.000 --> 40:39.550
Thanks to my sister
for forgiving my past misdeeds.

40:39.550 --> 40:40.510
In short,

40:40.670 --> 40:41.550
if I wanted to marry

40:41.550 --> 40:42.760
someone of a higher status,

40:42.760 --> 40:44.220
they wouldn't care for me,

40:44.510 --> 40:46.670
and I wouldn't
force myself on them either.

40:46.670 --> 40:47.870
If I settled for less,

40:47.960 --> 40:49.090
I wouldn't be happy.

40:49.360 --> 40:50.190
It's better to be alone

40:50.190 --> 40:51.590
and live a peaceful life.

40:52.150 --> 40:52.840
Now,

40:52.840 --> 40:53.840
I just want to learn from my sister

40:53.840 --> 40:55.440
how to do business properly,

40:55.590 --> 40:56.850
and save up more money.

40:57.190 --> 40:57.990
In the future,

40:58.510 --> 40:59.710
when my mom grows old,

41:00.000 --> 41:01.510
I will beg Old Madam Ji

41:01.670 --> 41:03.870
and bring her out so I can serve her well.

41:04.030 --> 41:06.230
I would be content with that for my life.

41:12.510 --> 41:12.960
You...

41:13.590 --> 41:15.390
why aren't you saying anything?

41:16.110 --> 41:16.590
I...

41:18.030 --> 41:19.670
I am a clumsy speaker.

41:20.510 --> 41:22.070
You have been through so much.

41:22.070 --> 41:23.330
If I were in your shoes,

41:23.590 --> 41:24.110
I would be exactly the same,

41:24.110 --> 41:25.770
only wanting to live on my own.

41:27.550 --> 41:28.360
But I truly

41:34.000 --> 41:35.060
feel sorry for you.

41:39.070 --> 41:39.840
So...

41:40.510 --> 41:42.000
so... so I really don't know

41:42.000 --> 41:42.930
what else to say.

41:50.920 --> 41:53.050
I... I brought some people with me.

41:53.230 --> 41:54.840
They are waiting outside.

41:56.880 --> 41:58.540
Why did you bring people over?

41:59.960 --> 42:00.760
I wanted...

42:04.030 --> 42:05.760
to give you a pond of lucky fish.

42:06.230 --> 42:07.880
Give me a pond of lucky fish?

42:08.550 --> 42:09.280
A few days ago,

42:09.280 --> 42:10.760
when I received your invitation,

42:10.760 --> 42:11.940
I went to find Rong.

42:12.230 --> 42:12.800
I asked him

42:12.800 --> 42:14.060
what exactly you like.

42:14.590 --> 42:15.630
Rong said,

42:15.630 --> 42:16.920
since you were pampered from a young age,

42:16.920 --> 42:17.950
you lack nothing.

42:18.150 --> 42:19.920
But after Madam Chen
arrived in the capital,

42:19.920 --> 42:21.280
your mother kept a pond of lucky fish

42:21.280 --> 42:22.400
in her courtyard,

42:23.280 --> 42:25.030
which you admired for a long time.

42:25.030 --> 42:25.960
So,

42:26.360 --> 42:27.440
I thought

42:28.110 --> 42:29.700
I would also build a pond

42:30.190 --> 42:31.250
in your courtyard,

42:31.440 --> 42:33.290
and keep some lucky fish in it.

42:33.440 --> 42:34.760
This way, when you have free time,

42:34.760 --> 42:36.030
you can watch the fish,

42:36.710 --> 42:38.910
and your heart might feel a bit lighter.

42:39.150 --> 42:40.030
I...

42:41.190 --> 42:43.050
also called some craftsmen over.

42:43.190 --> 42:44.110
Earlier, I was

42:44.710 --> 42:46.030
afraid it would be too presumptuous

42:46.030 --> 42:47.030
and scare you,

42:47.230 --> 42:47.920
so I...

42:49.150 --> 42:50.210
didn't let them in.

42:53.000 --> 42:54.860
You went through a lot of trouble.

42:55.670 --> 42:56.220
Then...

42:56.920 --> 42:58.260
let them come in.

42:58.320 --> 42:59.070
Sure!

43:00.710 --> 43:01.320
But...

43:06.000 --> 43:07.060
Let me lead the way.

43:07.710 --> 43:08.150
Okay.

43:11.630 --> 43:13.360
Is Lord Chen treating you well?

43:14.030 --> 43:14.670
Yes.

43:15.400 --> 43:16.430
That's good.

43:16.550 --> 43:17.880
I am truly happy for you.

43:18.760 --> 43:19.760
I was quite nervous

43:19.760 --> 43:21.650
about getting married.

43:22.030 --> 43:23.190
But the moment I think about

43:23.190 --> 43:24.510
you being in the Chen family,

43:24.510 --> 43:25.710
I don't worry as much.

43:26.440 --> 43:27.070
Wanxue,

43:27.550 --> 43:29.320
are you very fond of Xuanqing?

43:32.030 --> 43:33.230
But

43:33.360 --> 43:34.820
I don't know his feelings.

43:36.710 --> 43:37.970
Why would you say that?

43:39.360 --> 43:40.280
You don't know.

43:40.550 --> 43:41.510
After he returned to the capital,

43:41.510 --> 43:43.310
he has only been to my house once.

43:44.000 --> 43:45.460
He only spoke to my father,

43:45.630 --> 43:46.360
and as for me,

43:46.630 --> 43:48.000
he spoke less than two sentences

43:48.000 --> 43:48.930
before leaving.

43:54.150 --> 43:55.030
Wanxue,

43:57.880 --> 43:58.670
Third Aunt.

44:14.580 --> 44:17.900
[A Splendid Match]
